{"id":"ed545317bea3234d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STType.md","title":"STType","display":"STType","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STType","parameters":["B","C","k","g","t","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STType"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型判断与算法。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>独立声明式类型关系；绝不引用 Synth/Check。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STType B C k g t a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z780 (@ STTypeProof B C k g t a z780))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b8cc4863ae9f60a7\" href=\"?note=b8cc4863ae9f60a7\" title=\"ZFC_STTypeProof\">STTypeProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STType B C k g t a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_STTypeProof","status":"resolved","id":"b8cc4863ae9f60a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_STTypeProof|STTypeProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":805,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"29a3b60439beb1f3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STDenote|STDenote]]；[[ZFC_STErase|STErase]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"4db54302c309b031","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"8f06da4daca3bf2a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"bea9a9bf09bc4171","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_STAccept|STAccept]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"264bad855d440a7f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LStepBeta|LStepBeta]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]"},{"id":"3d1afdb1d67ab49e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LStepBetaEta|LStepBetaEta]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]"},{"id":"213b8fea49de0413","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_STEnv|STEnv]]；[[ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_STType|STType]]"},{"id":"8d767b7643021c66","anchor":"ref-6","loca